{"id":32012,"date":"2023-12-06T17:07:17","date_gmt":"2023-12-06T10:07:17","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/?page_id=32012"},"modified":"2025-11-17T13:57:42","modified_gmt":"2025-11-17T06:57:42","slug":"risk-management-and-business-intelligence-program-overview","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/risk-management-and-business-intelligence-program-overview\/","title":{"rendered":"Risk Management and Business Intelligence Program Overview"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"32012\" class=\"elementor elementor-32012\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-100c0c4 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"100c0c4\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8fc62ec e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"8fc62ec\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-db4c128 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"db4c128\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-73148ca1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"73148ca1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-342043a elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"342043a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Program Overview<\/h2>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-378e1c8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"378e1c8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A Bachelor\u2019s degree in Risk Management and Business Intelligence is a program that provides students with a comprehensive understanding of the intersection between business analytics, information technology, and risk management. The study combines theoretical concepts with practical applications in order to prepare students to analyse data and make informed decisions that mitigate business risks and improve organizational performance.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Students learn to develop risk management strategies, assess potential threats to businesses, evaluate financial risks, and analyse market trends. They also gain skills in data mining, statistical analysis, decision-making, database management, and software development. The program covers topics such as business intelligence, strategic management, enterprise risk management, fraud detection and prevention, cyber security, and compliance. Graduates can pursue careers in various industries, including finance, insurance, healthcare, government, and consulting firms.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Overall, a Bachelor\u2019s degree in Risk Management and Business Intelligence provides students with a strong foundation in both technical and business skills, making them well-equipped to succeed in today\u2019s data-driven business world.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cde10f3 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"cde10f3\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-67e51e8 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"67e51e8\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c769b08 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"c769b08\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e554648 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"e554648\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4c40bc3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"4c40bc3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Program Learning Outcomes<\/h2>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7dd0131 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"7dd0131\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">At the end of the 4-year program, graduates will be able to:<\/span><\/p><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Use quantitative and qualitative tools to assess risk and identify potential threats to businesses and organizations.<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Develop and implement comprehensive risk management plans to minimize losses and protect the interests of their companies and clients.<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Apply critical thinking and analytical skills to business intelligence data and use it to recommend data-driven strategies to help organizations remain competitive.<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Demonstrate knowledge of information security principles to protect data privacy and prevent data breaches.<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Effectively communicate complex risk management, business intelligence, and compliance issues to stakeholders, including senior executives, regulators, employees, and clients.<\/span><\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-99c0bf7 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"99c0bf7\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-32590bc e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"32590bc\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-67fe293 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"67fe293\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1d4eca9 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"1d4eca9\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9c5311c elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"9c5311c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Program Structure<\/h2>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3730962 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"3730962\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The 4-year Bachelor\u2019s Degree program contains 156 credits combining from 106 credits of coursework, 48 credits of internship and 2 credits of Industrial Placement Report. The courses are divided into three categories, including Common Courses, Specialized Courses, and Elective Courses.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ea21732 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"ea21732\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-926ef79 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"926ef79\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bf7f99d e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"bf7f99d\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-49ca4ec e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"49ca4ec\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-109089c elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"109089c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Common courses\u00a0<\/h2>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5c5c820 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"5c5c820\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>PRO101: Computer Fundamentals<\/p><p>HUM101: Introduction to Humanities<\/p><p>KHM101: Introduction to Khmer Studies and History<\/p><p>RES101: Research Methods<\/p><p>SDE101: Social and Digital Entrepreneurship<\/p><p>ENG103: Academic Writing Skills<\/p><p>PHI101: Philosophy and Anthropology of Technology<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-46739c1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"46739c1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<